</head><body class="linkedin-landing li-order-page"><header class="li-header"><a class="li-brand" href="./"><span class="li-brand-mark">H</span><span class="li-brand-name" translate="no">HireMe<span>LinkedIn</span></span></a><div class="li-language-slot"></div></header><main class="li-wrap" style="padding-block:64px"><h1>Votre retour depuis Chariow</h1><p style="margin:24px 0">Merci. Notre équipe doit vérifier votre paiement Chariow avant de confirmer votre commande.</p><a id="returnOrderLink" class="li-button" href="suivi-linkedin">Suivre ma commande</a><p style="margin-top:24px"><a href="https://wa.me/237654250688?text=Bonjour%20HireMe%2C%20j%E2%80%99ai%20besoin%20d%E2%80%99aide%20pour%20mon%20paiement%20LinkedIn%20via%20Chariow." target="_blank" rel="noopener">Contacter le support WhatsApp →</a></p></main><script>try{const saved=JSON.parse(sessionStorage.getItem('hireme.linkedin.chariow-order'));if(saved && /^HM-LI-\d{6}$/.test(saved.reference) && /^[a-f0-9]{32}$/.test(saved.token)){document.getElementById('returnOrderLink').href='commande.php?ref='+encodeURIComponent(saved.reference)+'&token='+encodeURIComponent(saved.token);fetch('../api/linkedin/chariow-return.php',{method:'POST',body:new URLSearchParams({reference:saved.reference,token:saved.token})}).catch(()=>{});}}catch(_){}</script></body></html>
